{"type":"json_object","message":"The reconciliation table confirms the chosen relationship: increase = ending balance at Dec. 27, 2008 minus beginning balance at Dec. 29, 2007 (start of fiscal 2007). Using the indexed values $214.4 million (source:t8c1n0) and $70.5 million (source:t1c2n0), the calculation gives 143.9 million, i.e. 214.4 - 70.5 = 143.9.","final":{"answer":"$143.9 million","value":143.9,"unit":"millions of dollars","calculation":"214.4 - 70.5 = 143.9","sources":["source:t8c1n0","source:t1c2n0"],"result_id":"tool:1","note":"Unrecognized tax benefits rose from $70.5 million at the beginning of fiscal 2007 to $214.4 million at December 27, 2008."}}